feature="A new feature to be implemented semi-autonomously via test-driven development: Start by preparing unit tests that capture exactly the requirements, make sure those tests fail at first, then code an implementation until all tests succeed."
bugfix="A bug fix to be implemented semi-autonomously via test-driven development: Start by preparing unit tests that reproduce exactly the described buggy conditions, make sure those tests fail at first, then code a fix until all tests succeed."
chore="Clean up or refactor parts of the codebase to improve maintainability, reusability, extensibility, and modularity."
plan="An area of future dev that needs a planning step before diving into implementation. Research the codebase and/or web resources to come up with a plan for upcoming development steps."
external="A need of an unusual kind beyond the project scope."
unknown="Chosen by mastory-prepare when turning string-typed tasks into objects."